**Evaluating minimal web enablement and plugin issues**

Running on web fails likely due to unsupported plugins causing runtime errors, blocking UI rendering. Adapting the app to use a web-safe storage initializer conditionally could enable browser testing with minimal functional impact, aligning with the requirement to verify UI without broad repo changes.
