**Evaluating web storage strategy**

The app currently defaults to LocalStorageInitializer, which relies on plugins unsupported on web and may cause runtime errors. Switching to MemoryStorageInitializer for web could prevent plugin errors and enable the app to run in browsers, though this requires a code change beyond just metadata updates.
