**Identifying font loading as app blocker**

The app fails to run because GoogleFonts throws an exception when it can't load fonts, likely due to network restrictions on font fetching. This causes layout widgets like MediaQuery to report zero sizes, indicating the engine never fully initializes.
thinking
**Planning to disable web font fetching**

Disabling GoogleFonts runtime fetching on web will avoid font load errors by using fallback fonts, preventing app crashes. I'll update main to conditionally disable fetching on web and switch to in-memory storage there to keep the app running without plugin errors.
